                            "en": "What sweet Celestia are you saying????You are heads over heels in love with those hideous creatures??",
                            "zh": "！"
                        },
                        "Delay": 0.3
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Your sexual proclivity is really...queer",
                            "zh": "我"
                        },
                        "Delay": 0.3
                    },
{
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Have you experienced a unrelenting black hole sucking you into oblivion??That's what I am talking about now.What's more,your taco has been sucked into that shit too.",
